      "id": "part2",
      "type": "solution_discussion",
      "timeLimit": 4,
      "situation": "<p class='mb-1'>[scenario]</p><p class='mb-1'>You are considering the following options:</p><ul><li>Option 1: ...</li><li>Option 2: ...</li><li>Option 3: ...</li></ul><p class='mb-2'>Choose the best option and explain your reasons.</p>"
